'''Bacha XX''' (Bacha Lazmyq Qodzar Bylam ish Zhifol; born DAY MONTH {{abbr|2368|1967 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}) is a member of the [[Qymish royal family]] who reigned as [[King of Qym]] from DAY MONTH {{abbr|2441|2027.8 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} to DAY MONTH {{abbr|2443|2029.46 (Earth Year Equivalent)}}. He is the younger brother of [[Bacha XVIII of Qym|King Bacha XVIII]], uncle of [[Bacha XIX of Qym|King Bacha XIX]], and father of [[Qodzar of Qym|King Qodzar]]. He was known until {{abbr|2441|2027.8 (Earth Year Equivalent)}} as Prince Lazmyq. 

